 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Title 'Master Renban', breadcrumb 'Master - Master Renban'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Input Renban in Add Mode: Plant 'Select plant', Dest 'Enter dest', Renban Code 'Enter renban code', Source 'Select source'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Plant list = plant master ordered by code; Source list = source master ordered by code (masters TBD, OP-02 / OP-03).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "List: SELECT all rows of ielp.MS_RENBAN_TCPBR ordered by entry (CREATED_DT, ID) (TBD); 25 rows per page. No data: message no. 15.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "SELECT R.PLANT_CD, P.PLANT_NAME, R.DEST_CD, R.RENBAN_CD, R.SOURCE_CD, R.CREATED_BY, R.CREATED_DT, R.CHANGED_DT, R.CHANGED_BY, R.VERSION",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "FROM ielp.MS_RENBAN_TCPBR R LEFT JOIN Plant source (TBD) P ON P.PLANT_CD = R.PLANT_CD ORDER BY R.CREATED_DT, R.ID (column names TBD)",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Input Normalisation",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Dest and Renban Code: trim leading / trailing spaces and convert to upper case on the client and again on the server.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Plant and Source store the code only; the description is never saved in the renban table.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 Save (Add / Edit)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Step 1 - Mandatory: Plant (no. 1), Dest (no. 2), Renban Code (no. 3), Source (no. 4). All messages shown at once under the fields. Stop.",
    "Step 2 - Plant and Source exist in their lists (server check; no. 5 / 6). Stop.",
    "Step 3 - Dest matches ^[A-Z0-9]{1,10}$ (no. 7); Renban Code matches ^[A-Z0-9]{1,3}$ (no. 8). Stop.",
    "Step 4 - Unique key: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ielp.MS_RENBAN_TCPBR WHERE PLANT_CD = :plant AND DEST_CD = :dest AND RENBAN_CD = :renban [AND NOT (edited row key)] > 0 -> no. 9. Stop.",
    "Step 5 - Add: INSERT (Data Map block 1). Edit: UPDATE ... WHERE old key AND VERSION = :version; 0 rows updated -> no. 10.",
    "Step 6 - COMMIT; on exception ROLLBACK and no. 18.",
    "Success: reset to Add Mode, refresh list on the page of the saved row and highlight it; no. 11 / 12."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The unique check is also enforced by a DB unique constraint on (PLANT_CD, DEST_CD, RENBAN_CD) (TBD); a constraint violation returns the same message.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Plant",
     "width": 8
    },
    {
     "title": "Dest",
     "width": 7
    },
    {
     "title": "Renban",
     "width": 7
    },
    {
     "title": "Result",
     "width": 24
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "KRW 3",
     "721C",
     "X",
     "Rejected, no. 9 (exists)"
    ],
    [
     "STR 2",
     "721C",
     "X",
     "Saved (other plant)"
    ],
    [
     "STR 2",
     "812D",
     "T",
     "Exists already, same renban as 722C / T is allowed"
    ],
    [
     "KRW 3",
     "72-1",
     "X",
     "Rejected, no. 7"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 Edit / Delete",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Edit (✎): load PLANT_CD, DEST_CD, RENBAN_CD, SOURCE_CD and VERSION into Input Renban; title 'Edit Renban - {key}'; all fields editable (RB-05).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Cancel: discard and return to Add Mode.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Delete (🗑): confirmation no. 13; DELETE ... WHERE key AND VERSION = :version; 0 rows -> no. 10; success no. 14.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Check whether the renban is used in transactions before delete: TBD (OP-06).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Search, Table View, Export .xls",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Search: client-side filter, partial and case-insensitive, on all visible columns; no match: no. 16.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Table View: show / hide columns; hidden columns are not exported.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Export .xls: SpreadsheetML (Excel 2003 XML), sheet 'Master Renban', header row bold, all filtered rows; file 'Master_Renban_YYYYMMDD.xls'; no. 17.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Paging",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Rows per page 10 / 25 / 50 / 100 (default 25); « ‹ [pages] › »; max 5 page buttons; 'Showing n to m of x entries'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 Concurrency and Transaction",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Optimistic locking with VERSION: the version read with the row is sent on Save / Delete; the server updates only when it is unchanged.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Each Save / Delete is one DB transaction; Save is disabled while a request is running.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Security and Audit",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Access follows the existing role framework (View / Add / Edit / Delete / Export Master Renban, TBD).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Audit fields CREATED_BY / CREATED_DT on insert, CHANGED_BY / CHANGED_DT on update; format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MI:SS. Data loaded by system shows SYSTEM.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "page_break"
  },
